{"4967660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ball-Aqua", "steam_appid": 4967660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5011940], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. <strong>Roll</strong> your ball through <strong>obstacle courses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a <strong>physics ball</strong> across suspended <strong>rails</strong>, <strong>spinning fans</strong>, fragile <strong>glass</strong>, and more. <strong>Roll</strong> fast, <strong>jump</strong> gaps, and master the <strong>inertia</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop easy <strong>bubbles</strong>, reach challenging <strong>stars</strong>. Beat the target <strong>time</strong> and grab every collectible for a <strong>100%</strong> clear to unlock <strong>skins</strong> for your ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/acb9905f90a28864622d46b454bd4f12.poster.avif?t=1787564545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/acb9905f90a28864622d46b454bd4f12.webm?t=1787564545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/acb9905f90a28864622d46b454bd4f12.mp4?t=1787564545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. <strong>Campaign</strong>, custom levels, and Workshop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong>: Hand-crafted courses that teach and challenge the core mechanics. Clear a stage to unlock the next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom</strong>: Save and play levels you build in the Level Editor. Share them on Workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop</strong>: Subscribe to community tracks and browse the in-game catalog.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. <strong>Freeroam</strong> and <strong>Race</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Host</strong> or join open Steam <strong>lobbies</strong>. Invite <strong>friends</strong>. Play <strong>campaign</strong> or <strong>custom</strong> levels together - or race them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3.1 <strong>Freeroam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish levels <strong>solo</strong> or in <strong>co-op</strong> (up to 99 players). Roll the course, collect <strong>stars</strong> and <strong>bubbles</strong>, set <strong>checkpoints</strong>, and reach the finish. Each player tracks their own collectibles - when everyone has finished at least once, the host can move the group to the next course. Practice routes, explore Workshop maps, or unwind before Race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3.2 <strong>Race</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, every player picks and places one <strong>building piece</strong> - a helpful ramp, a nasty wall, or a watery trap. Help yourself or block the pack, then race the course you just remixed. First to finish earns the <strong>stars</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/63b8a8dbb1f30a66aa15b75285dcc8f1.poster.avif?t=1787564545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/63b8a8dbb1f30a66aa15b75285dcc8f1.webm?t=1787564545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/63b8a8dbb1f30a66aa15b75285dcc8f1.mp4?t=1787564545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. <strong>Level editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build courses: place rails, floors, props, glass, fans, and collectibles on an optional grid. Fly the camera, multi-select, rotate, duplicate, and <strong>playtest</strong> instantly. Set your own target time, then export and publish to Steam Workshop - with auto-generated preview images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/5d145b3d52015e8b2d01e815f112ab70.poster.avif?t=1787564545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/5d145b3d52015e8b2d01e815f112ab70.webm?t=1787564545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/5d145b3d52015e8b2d01e815f112ab70.mp4?t=1787564545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5. <strong>Skin editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint custom ball skins with your own colors and textures, then save them for play or share on Steam Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6. <strong>Frutiger Aero</strong> grass and ocean beaches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright grass, warm sand, and cool glass under open sky. Flowers, fish, and butterflies drift by as you roll - sunny, watery, and a little nostalgic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7. <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable and custom ball skins, plus Steam Workshop sharing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard, mouse, and gamepad with full rebinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 languages supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactile audio with separate master, music, and SFX volume</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water ripples, inertia squash-and-stretch, and ground particles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liquid Glass UI with real frosted backdrop blur</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics settings: bloom, shadows, TAA, V-Sync, FPS cap, window modes, resolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional ray tracing on DirectX 12, including colored shadows</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/4dd3a76d5f940d775d2b93d7e7d27ec5.poster.avif?t=1787564545\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/4dd3a76d5f940d775d2b93d7e7d27ec5.webm?t=1787564545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967660/extras/4dd3a76d5f940d775d2b93d7e7d27ec5.mp4?t=1787564545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. <strong>Roll</strong> your ball through <strong>obstacle courses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a <strong>physics ball</strong> across suspended <strong>rails</strong>, <strong>spinning fans</strong>, fragile <strong>glass</strong>, and more. <strong>Roll</strong> fast, <strong>jump</strong> gaps, and master the <strong>inertia</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop easy <strong>bubbles</strong>, reach challenging <strong>stars</strong>. Beat the target <strong>time</strong> and grab every collectible for a <strong>100%</strong> clear to unlock <strong>skins</strong> for your ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto